  "expertText": "* = $0801\n\n\n; Koala layout: bitmap $2000, screen $3F40, color $4328. Copy screen→$0400 (default screen RAM, D018=$18) and color→$D800. 4×250-byte loops each.\n; Copy screen color data: $3F40→$0400, 4×250 bytes\n.macro Copy\n    LDX #$00\nscr_copy0:\n    LDA $3F40,X\n    STA $0400,X\n    INX\n    CPX #$FA\n    BNE scr_copy0\n    LDX #$00\nscr_copy1:\n    LDA $403A,X\n    STA $04FA,X\n    INX\n    CPX #$FA\n    BNE scr_copy1\n    LDX #$00\nscr_copy2:\n    LDA $4134,X\n    STA $05F4,X\n    INX\n    CPX #$FA\n    BNE scr_copy2\n    LDX #$00\nscr_copy3:\n    LDA $422E,X\n    STA $06EE,X\n    INX\n    CPX #$FA\n    BNE scr_copy3\n; Copy color RAM: $4328→$D800, 4×250 bytes\n    LDX #$00\ncol_copy0:\n    LDA $4328,X\n    STA $D800,X\n    INX\n    CPX #$FA\n    BNE col_copy0\n    LDX #$00\ncol_copy1:\n    LDA $4422,X\n    STA $D8FA,X\n    INX\n    CPX #$FA\n    BNE col_copy1\n    LDX #$00\ncol_copy2:\n    LDA $451C,X\n    STA $D9F4,X\n    INX\n    CPX #$FA\n    BNE col_copy2\n    LDX #$00\ncol_copy3:\n    LDA $4616,X\n    STA $DAEE,X\n    INX\n    CPX #$FA\n    BNE col_copy3\n.endm \n",
